{{scandal}}{{/ˈskændl}}{{n. 丑闻； scandal}}{{The politician was involved in a scandal.}}
{{scarce}}{{/skeəs}}{{adj. 稀缺的； scarce；不足的}}{{Water is scarce in desert regions.}}
{{schedule}}{{/ˈʃedjuːl}}{{n./v. 时间表； schedule；安排}}{{The meeting is scheduled for Monday.}}
