{{scope}}{{/skəʊp}}{{n. 范围； scope；机会}}{{The scope of the project has expanded.}}
{{scrutiny}}{{/ˈskruːtəni}}{{n. 审查； scrutiny；仔细检查}}{{The report was under intense scrutiny.}}
{{sector}}{{/ˈsektər}}{{n. 部门； sector；领域}}{{The private sector drives innovation.}}
{{secure}}{{/sɪˈkjʊər}}{{adj./v. 安全的； secure；获得}}{{The building is well secured.}}
{{segment}}{{/ˈseɡmənt}}{{n. 部分； segment；片段}}{{The company targets a specific segment.}}
{{seize}}{{/siːz}}{{v. 抓住； seize；没收}}{{Police seized the stolen goods.}}
{{select}}{{/sɪˈlekt}}{{v. 选择； select；选拔}}{{She was selected for the team.}}
{{semester}}{{/sɪˈmestər}}{{n. 学期； semester}}{{The spring semester starts in February.}}
{{seminar}}{{/ˈsemɪnɑːr}}{{n. 研讨会； seminar}}{{The seminar was very informative.}}
{{senior}}{{/ˈsiːniər}}{{adj./n. 高级的； senior；年长者}}{{She is a senior executive.}}
