{{session}}{{/ˈseʃn}}{{n. 会议； session；一段时间}}{{The training session was three hours long.}}
{{setback}}{{/ˈsetbæk}}{{n. 挫折； setback}}{{The project suffered a setback.}}
{{settle}}{{/ˈsetl}}{{v. 解决； settle；定居}}{{They settled the dispute out of court.}}
{{severe}}{{/sɪˈvɪər}}{{adj. 严重的； severe；严厉的}}{{The drought caused severe damage.}}
{{shelter}}{{/ˈʃeltər}}{{n./v. 庇护所； shelter；躲避}}{{The building provides shelter for the homeless.}}
{{shift}}{{/ʃɪft}}{{v./n. 转移； shift；转变}}{{There has been a shift in public opinion.}}
{{shrink}}{{/ʃrɪŋk}}{{v. 收缩； shrink；减少}}{{The economy shrank last year.}}
{{signal}}{{/ˈsɪɡnl}}{{n./v. 信号； signal；表明}}{{The company sent a positive signal.}}
{{significance}}{{/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns}}{{n. 重要性； significance；意义}}{{The discovery has great significance.}}
{{simultaneous}}{{/ˌsɪmlˈteɪniəs}}{{adj. 同时的； simultaneous}}{{The events were almost simultaneous.}}
{{skeptical}}{{/ˈskeptɪkl}}{{adj. 怀疑的； skeptical}}{{Many experts are skeptical about the claim.}}
{{slim}}{{/slɪm}}{{adj./v. 苗条的； slim；微小的}}{{The chances of success are slim.}}
{{snap}}{{/snæp}}{{v./n. 折断； snap；快照}}{{The branch snapped in the wind.}}
{{soar}}{{/sɔːr}}{{v. 飙升； soar；翱翔}}{{Prices soared to record levels.}}
{{sole}}{{/səʊl}}{{adj./n. 唯一的； sole；鞋底}}{{She is the sole survivor.}}
{{solemn}}{{/ˈsɒləm}}{{adj. 庄严的； solemn；严肃的}}{{The ceremony was a solemn occasion.}}
{{sophisticated}}{{/səˈfɪstɪkeɪtɪd}}{{adj. 复杂的； sophisticated；老练的}}{{The system uses sophisticated algorithms.}}
{{source}}{{/sɔːs}}{{n. 来源； source；源头}}{{What is the source of the data?}}
{{span}}{{/spæn}}{{n./v. 跨度； span；持续}}{{The bridge spans the river.}}
{{spark}}{{/spɑːk}}{{v./n. 引发； spark；火花}}{{The incident sparked a debate.}}
{{specialize}}{{/ˈspeʃəlaɪz}}{{v. 专门从事； specialize}}{{She specializes in family law.}}
{{species}}{{/ˈspiːʃiːz}}{{n. 物种； species}}{{Many species face extinction.}}
{{speculate}}{{/ˈspekjuleɪt}}{{v. 推测； speculate；投机}}{{Analysts speculated about the outcome.}}
{{sphere}}{{/sfɪər}}{{n. 领域； sphere；球体}}{{She works in the sphere of education.}}
{{spill}}{{/spɪl}}{{v./n. 溢出； spill；泄露}}{{Oil spilled into the river.}}
{{spin}}{{/spɪn}}{{v./n. 旋转； spin；纺纱}}{{The wheel spins rapidly.}}
{{spirit}}{{/ˈspɪrɪt}}{{n. 精神； spirit；灵魂}}{{The team showed great spirit.}}
{{sponsor}}{{/ˈspɒnsər}}{{n./v. 赞助者； sponsor；赞助}}{{The event was sponsored by a major brand.}}
{{squeeze}}{{/skwiːz}}{{v./n. 挤压； squeeze；压缩}}{{The company squeezed costs to improve margins.}}
